{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Development","identifiers":["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/Testing"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Development"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"RoundTripREST extracts the REST library previously shipped as ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SLREST"},{"text":" in SwiftLibs. It depends on the separate ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RoundTrip"},{"text":" HTTP product.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Before","import SLHttp","import SLREST","","\/\/ After","import RoundTrip","import RoundTripREST"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roundtrip-swift"},{"text":" package dependency, then replace the SwiftLibs products with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".product(name: \"RoundTrip\", package: \"roundtrip-swift\")"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".product(name: \"RoundTripREST\", package: \"roundtrip-swift\")"},{"text":". The main REST names stay the same: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RestClient"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkService"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BaseURLProvider"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ApiKeyProvider"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultHttpHeaderProvider"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"RoundTripREST supports Apple platforms only. Remove Linux targets that used "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SLREST"},{"type":"text","text":" before moving to the extracted package."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The REST provider, service, and client protocols now conform to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", so implementations must satisfy Swift 6 concurrency checking. WebSocket factories are main-actor isolated. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkService"},{"type":"text","text":" and its session delegate are final, and the delegate’s header subject is immutable; replace subclasses with protocol-based wrappers or injected implementations of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkServiceProtocol"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/roundtriprest\/migrationfromswiftlibs"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/MigrationFromSwiftLibs","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Documentation index","identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Documentation index","type":"text"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"Migrating from SLREST","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"RoundTripREST"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://RoundTripREST/documentation/RoundTripREST":{"title":"RoundTripREST","url":"\/documentation\/roundtriprest","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build API clients on top of RoundTrip’s request and transfer types."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol"},"doc://RoundTripREST/documentation/RoundTripREST/Testing":{"title":"Testing REST clients","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/Testing","type":"topic","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Documentation index","identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{